Have you been drinking?

18
00:01:12.346 --> 00:01:14.372
No.
Of course she hasn't.

19
00:01:15.851 --> 00:01:18.981
- Somebody has.
- I've been drinking.

20
00:01:19.057 --> 00:01:21.754
You all right?
Uh, I'm- I'm- I'm not, uh-

21
00:01:21.828 --> 00:01:25.561
