Uh, almost-

22
00:01:25.635 --> 00:01:28.127
Ma'am, step out of the vehicle.

23
00:01:32.112 --> 00:01:35.049
- [Sighs]
- Ma'am, walk to the rear of the car.

24
00:01:35.117 --> 00:01:37.086
Naomi. Are-

25
00:01:38.155 --> 00:01:41.058
Naomi?

26
00:01:42.897 --> 00:01:44.991
- Naomi.
- Sir, remain in the car.

27
00:01:45.067 --> 00:01:47.628
Hey, listen.
She's not drunk.
I will arrest you, sir.

28
00:01:47.705 --> 00:01:50.004
