it doesn't look like a stroke.

33
00:02:34.718 --> 00:02:36.744
No bleeds, no clots.

34
00:02:36.822 --> 00:02:39.053
Thank God.
It sounds like
there's bad news.

35
00:02:39.126 --> 00:02:41.789
