It's preeclampsia, isn't it?

38
00:02:47.306 --> 00:02:51.438
- I'm gonna miscarry, aren't I?
- Preeclampsia is a possibility.
But let's not get ahead of ourselves.

39
00:02:51.513 --> 00:02:53.448
I've miscarried three times.
I'm 39.

40
00:02:53.517 --> 00:02:56.420
We had to use in vitro. You've
gotta make sure the baby's okay.

41
00:02:56.488 --> 00:02:58.923
Let's make sure that
you're okay first.

42
00:02:58.992 --> 00:03:02.157
How about we take care of
both of you at the same time?

43
00:03:02.232 --> 00:03:06.295
The nurse will be in soon
to take some blood.
I'd like to run some more tests.

44
00:03:06.371 --> 00:03:08.670
- Thank you, Doctor.
- Thank you.

45
00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.572
Where is everybody?
No one's in the office?

46
00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.815
No. I haven't heard from
Cameron all day.
You seen House?

47
00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:19.793
