51
00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:41.119
There's a new drug called
8C12 that's shown promise
in Phase II trials.

52
00:03:41.196 --> 00:03:43.791
It's your best shot.

53
00:03:43.868 --> 00:03:46.702
Thank you, Doctor.

54
00:03:46.773 --> 00:03:49.368
You've been so good to me and-

55
00:03:49.444 --> 00:03:51.811
Well, l- I did...

56
00:03:51.882 --> 00:03:54.317
publicly bash
your company's drug.

57
00:03:54.386 --> 00:03:56.685
When I think about
how I treated you-

58
00:03:56.756 --> 00:03:59.089
Oh, hey. Come on.

59
00:04:02.166 --> 00:04:04.727
There, there, there.

60
00:04:09.111 --> 00:04:11.706
So, um, there is some hope.

61
00:04:11.782 --> 00:04:13.944
Always.

62
00:04:14.019 --> 00:04:17.115
