Negative for alcohol and drugs.

81
00:05:09.747 --> 00:05:12.012
She was on oxybutynin.
For incontinence.

82
00:05:12.084 --> 00:05:16.284
Yeah. Well, we took her off.
No change. B.U.N. And creatinine
are up. L.F.T.'s slightly elevated.

83
00:05:16.357 --> 00:05:20.820
Preeclampsia.
Call the OB-GYN service
and rub some prayer beads.

84
00:05:20.898 --> 00:05:26.066
- B.P.'s normal.
No preeclampsia in other pregnancies.
- Because she didn't carry for long enough.

85
00:05:26.141 --> 00:05:29.203
The three miscarriages
make me think
it's an underlying physiology.

86
00:05:29.279 --> 00:05:32.546
Pregnancy-related autoimmunity.

87
00:05:34.221 --> 00:05:36.019
Too bad that Cameron quit.

88
00:05:36.091 --> 00:05:38.925
We could use
an immunologist right now.

89
00:05:38.996 --> 00:05:42.695
- We'll see if you're right.
Check the blood.
- Cameron quit?

90
00:05:42.768 --> 00:05:44.862
Last night.

91
00:05:44.939 --> 00:05:47.534
And do an M.R.A. For vasculitis too.

92
00:05:47.611 --> 00:05:50.240
There's no way she quit.

93
00:05:50.315 --> 00:05:52.876
She got fired because
you couldn't swallow your pride.

94
00:05:52.952 --> 00:05:55.581
An ultrasound?
Excellent thought.

95
00:05:55.657 --> 00:05:59.060
